EastSun 1001 (Config menu screenshot): "圖片上的我不要粗體 我要細明體". The bold came from ht9xxx.css .smi font-weight:bold; main.html's
.submenu .smi now sets font-weight:normal and font-family 細明體 / MingLiU, then 新細明體 / PMingLiU, serif (mingliu.ttc is
installed here). Only the three menus change; sizes, items and the grey / strike rules are untouched. Headless Edge at the
110 % UI zoom: thin MingLiU, every label fits its 186px column.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 page/main.html | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/page/main.html b/page/main.html
index 8676036..9617f90 100644
--- a/page/main.html
+++ b/page/main.html
@@ -36,7 +36,7 @@
   .submenu{padding:6px;gap:4px;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,165px);}
   #palSetup,#palConfig{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,186px);}
   #palDebug{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,max-content);}   /* 中文長名字（「實機截圖預覽（尚未 dfm 轉換）」）放大後 165px 裝不下 → 兩欄、依字寬 */
-  .submenu .smi{padding:8px 9px;font-size:calc(17px*var(--fsx,1));line-height:24px;border-width:2px;}
+  .submenu .smi{padding:8px 9px;font-size:calc(17px*var(--fsx,1));line-height:24px;border-width:2px;font-weight:normal;font-family:"細明體","MingLiU","新細明體","PMingLiU",serif;}   /* AI(W906-MENU-MINGLIU) 20261001：EastSun「我不要粗體 我要細明體」——蓋掉 ht9xxx.css .smi 的 font-weight:bold；只改三個選單 */
   .submenu .smic{width:24px;height:24px;vertical-align:top;margin-right:8px;}
   .submenu .smic svg{width:24px;height:24px;}
   .submenu .smi.shot::after,.submenu .smi.ruleoff::after{font-size:14px;vertical-align:top;}
